  "label": "Monday morning dread",
  "description": "A common social phenomenon where individuals experience negative emotions such as exhaustion, reluctance, or anxiety at the start of a workweek, particularly on Mondays. This is a widely recognized cultural trope, often humorously exaggerated in memes and media to express shared workplace fatigue or the psychological resistance to returning to routine after the weekend.",
